   193	the official USTR/Federal Register announcements, merged to monthly HS-10 trade
   194	data; the tariff schedule is a hand-assembled research input frozen at publication.
   195	This paper differs by making the statutory schedule itself the output: dated
   196	executable rules citing each instrument, continuously conformance-tested against an
   197	independent implementation, and covering the 2025–26 authorities (IEEPA, §122, §201,
   198	§232, §301, §338) rather than the 2018–19 waves.
